    "body": "To voice an alternative opinion, I would be very confused if starship disabled the greeting. The initial greeting and the prompt don't seem to have anything to do with each other.\r\n\r\nThis is a tool for generating a prompt, it's not a theme.\r\n\r\nThat being said, all that's needed is the line `set fish_greeting` in the fish config, so adding it to src/init/starship.fish is the only change necessary if you decide to implement it.",
